WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:10.219
This video shows how to set up a finance account on your phone. Accounts are the places where your school's money is kept, like a cash box or a bank account.

00:00:11.889 --> 00:00:20.793
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and then choose Accounts. Tap Manage Accounts to see your accounts as cards.

00:00:21.546 --> 00:00:29.202
Tap Add Account at the top of the page. A form opens with the account name, type and opening balance.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:40.892
Type the account name, here Petty Cash. Choose the type, which can be Cash, Bank or Person. Then enter the opening balance, here 5000.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:49.918
Below that is the Visible to Staff box. Keep it ticked if staff members should be able to see this account and its transactions.

00:00:50.378 --> 00:01:02.858
Tap Save. A message confirms the account, and a new Petty Cash card appears in the list. Before collecting fees, create at least one Cash account and one Bank account.

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:13.086
Your account is ready to use. Next, you can set up fees and start collecting payments.
